  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using ViT as the image encoder (config_037) significantly improves performance compared to ResNet. However, uncertainty remains about whether the RNA encoder choice (scvi_n200 vs. scgpt) further impacts performance when paired with a high-quality image encoder. This experiment tests scgpt RNA with ViT image in a multiprofile setup, isolating the RNA encoder's contribution while leveraging the proven effectiveness of ViT. This comparison directly addresses a key design decision (RNA encoder choice) with minimal changes to the already high-performing configuration."
